        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: southern Africa, Zambezi River, Zambia, Zimbabwe, United Arab Emirates\n- People: Cecil Rhodes\n- Topics: British protectorates, borders, country formation\n\nFacts:\n- A former British protectorate in southern Africa later became two countries separated by the Zambezi River.\n- Zambia lies north of the Zambezi River.\n- Zimbabwe lies south of the Zambezi River.\n- Cecil Rhodes founded the territory, and Cecil Rhodes also established the Groote Schuur Zoo.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
