        "original_id": "d21bf5e9-a23b-5e37-b96d-0193314622f5",
        "text": "The former British protectorate of the southern Africa territory became two countries with the Zambezi river as the border. UAE lies to the south; Zambia is north of the river. It was founded by the man who established the Groote Schuur Zoo.",
